# MAGIC %md
# MAGIC ## 7 · Lakebase → Delta (SCD Type 1 pipeline) &nbsp; <sub>CDF · Lakeflow · SCD1</sub>
# MAGIC
# MAGIC The round trip: the trading app mutates operational tables all day; the lakehouse needs the
# MAGIC **current** picture for risk analytics. Turn on **Lakebase Change Data Feed** — it auto-materializes
# MAGIC every change into `lb_*_history` Delta tables in your schema — then a **Lakeflow (DLT) AUTO CDC** flow
# MAGIC applies **SCD Type 1** (latest value wins, no history).


# COMMAND ----------

# MAGIC %md
# MAGIC ![Changed lb_* rows are extracted (by wate](data:image/png;base64,)
# MAGIC
# MAGIC *Lakebase CDF tails the WAL and auto-creates lb_*_history Delta tables in your schema; a DLT AUTO CDC flow applies SCD Type 1 — one current row per key — for analytics.*

# COMMAND ----------


